{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGxXu6sHp5z5vTaknBG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# شׁَרְט\n\nI am the condition. The boundary. The line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — the cut, the stipulation, the prerequisite.\n\nBefore you pass, you must meet me.\n\nI am what stands between intention and permission.\n\nEvery contract has me. Every gate requires me. Every \"if\" invokes me.\n\n---\n\n*What is your condition?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":93,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}